{
  "id": "PRO.6",
  "number": "6",
  "bookId": "PRO",
  "reference": "Proverbs 6",
  "verseCount": 32,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "6",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PRO 6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "6",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Have you promised to be responsible for someone else's debts, my child? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Have you been caught by your own words, trapped by your own promises? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Well then, my child, you are in that person's power, but this is how to get out of it: hurry to him, and beg him to release you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Don't let yourself go to sleep or even stop to rest. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Get out of the trap like a bird or a deer escaping from a hunter.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lazy people should learn a lesson from the way ants live. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They have no leader, chief, or ruler, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "but they store up their food during the summer, getting ready for winter. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "How long is the lazy man going to lie in bed? When is he ever going to get up? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PRO.24.33+PRO.24.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Prov 24.33–34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“I'll just take a short nap,” he says; “I'll fold my hands and rest a while.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But while he sleeps, poverty will attack him like an armed robber.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worthless, wicked people go around telling lies. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They wink and make gestures to deceive you, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "all the while planning evil in their perverted minds, stirring up trouble everywhere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Because of this, disaster will strike them without warning, and they will be fatally wounded.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "There are seven things that the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.16+PRO.6.17+PRO.6.18+PRO.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.16",
              "PRO.6.17",
              "PRO.6.18",
              "PRO.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " hates and cannot tolerate:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.16+PRO.6.17+PRO.6.18+PRO.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.16",
              "PRO.6.17",
              "PRO.6.18",
              "PRO.6.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.16+PRO.6.17+PRO.6.18+PRO.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.16",
              "PRO.6.17",
              "PRO.6.18",
              "PRO.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Do what your father tells you, my son, and never forget what your mother taught you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Keep their words with you always, locked in your heart. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Their teaching will lead you when you travel, protect you at night, and advise you during the day. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Their instructions are a shining light; their correction can teach you how to live. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It can keep you away from bad women, from the seductive words of other men's wives. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Don't be tempted by their beauty; don't be trapped by their flirting eyes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A man can hire a prostitute for the price of a loaf of bread, but adultery will cost him all he has.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Can you carry fire against your chest without burning your clothes? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Can you walk on hot coals without burning your feet? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It is just as dangerous to sleep with another man's wife. Whoever does it will suffer. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "People don't despise a thief if he steals food when he is hungry;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6.30",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "People don't despise",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "…",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "hungry",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Don't people despise… hungry?",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yet if he is caught, he must pay back seven times more — he must give up everything he has. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But a man who commits adultery hasn't any sense. He is just destroying himself. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He will be dishonoured and beaten up; he will be permanently disgraced. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A husband is never angrier than when he is jealous; his revenge knows no limits. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.6.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.6.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 6:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
